   "latex": "\\exfigure{716_q18_s1}\n\nObtuse $\\angle ABC = 180^\\circ - 60^\\circ = 120^\\circ$ (straight line).\n\n$\\angle BCA = 180^\\circ - 42^\\circ - 120^\\circ = 18^\\circ$ (angle sum of triangle).",
